<Page
  title="About this project"
  description="This wiki is the output of a workshop held at the Summer Academy of the German Academic Scholarship Foundation (Studienstiftung des deutschen Volkes) in Leysin, Switzerland, in August 2026. For a…"
  current="about"
  headings={headings}
