            >The 100 Days Mission</ExternalLink
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          CEPI, topical: <ExternalLink
            href="https://cepi.net/cepi-fast-tracks-three-bundibugyo-ebolavirus-vaccine-candidates"
            >CEPI fast-tracks three Bundibugyo ebolavirus vaccine candidates</ExternalLink
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <ExternalLink href="https://gh.bmj.com/content/7/7/e009709"
            >A pandemic treaty for equitable global access to medical countermeasures: seven
